ioritize improving performance (expect higher mean and best performance within a few iterations), while retaining modest encouragement for non-central designs to preserve some diversity.\",\n  \"validation_plan\": \"Compare next accepted-state population metrics (mean and best performance) against the current state (best=0.0468, mean=0.0455) and distance_from_center diversity (mean=0.2420, range\u22480.0266). Acceptance requires the independent validator to show improvement over the current state.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.70\n}</decision>", "change_id": "7e78c32d2ca5cc8d", "candidate_state": {"version": 0, "planner_guidance": null, "objective_ops": [{"op": "set_weight", "name": "distance_from_center", "weight": 0.1}], "implementation_patches": {}, "workflow_params": {}}, "validation": {"seeds": [1000, 1001], "use_planner": false, "mode": "sequential", "max_stages": 3, "candidate_objectives": ["performance", "distance_from_center"], "baseline_objectives": ["performance", "distance_from_center"], "baseline": [0.041320837607518784, 0.041320837607518784], "candidate": [0.041320837607518784, 0.041320837607518784], "baseline_mean": 0.041320837607518784, "candidate_mean": 0.041320837607518784, "delta": 0.0, "min_improvement": 0.02, "candidate_constraint_violation": false, "details": {"baseline": [{"split": "validation", "top_k": 5, "top_k_by_true_quality": 0.041320837607518784, "population_mean": 0.041320837607518784, "best": 0.041320837607518784, "n_invalid": 0}, {"split": "validation", "top_k": 5, "top_k_by_true_quality": 0.041320837607518784, "population_mean": 0.041320837607518784, "best": 0.041320837607518784, "n_invalid": 0}], "candidate": [{"split": "validation", "top_k": 5, "top_k_by_true_quality": 0.041320837607518784, "population_mean": 0.041320837607518784, "best": 0.041320837607518784, "n_invalid": 0}, {"split": "validation", "top_k": 5, "top_k_by_true_quality": 0.041320837607518784, "population_mean": 0.041320837607518784, "best": 0.041320837607518784, "n_inval